s student who can assist with college projects, communications, and operations. View Details Bookmark College of Business Marketing Intern 310000 - Dean-College of Business S1732026 Student 08/19/2026 The UCA College of Business is looking to invest in TWO Marketing Interns by hiring UCA business majors.Students are encouraged to use this paid internship to earn credit hours, such as MKTG 3V82.For more information on business internships for academic credit and the requirements, please visit: https://uca.edu/business/internshipThis opportunity begins at one semester, but the paid opportunity... View Details Bookmark Student Worker 353000 - History S1652026 Student 08/17/2026 09/04/2026 General office related duties. View Details Bookmark Food Preparation Supervisor/Cook 755000 - College Square Retirement Ctr NC1092026 Staff 08/24/2026 The Food Preparation Supervisor (Cook) is responsible for meal preparation, supervision of part-time servers, directing food service activities in the absence of the Food Service Director, monitoring security and safety practices, coordinating the production and serving of food. This position is governed by state and federal laws and agency/institution policy. View Details Bookmark Admissions Student Worker 131000 - Admissions & Enrollment Support S1642026 Student 08/14/2026 09/09/2026 Student workers are responsible for providing support to the Office of Admissions, department team members, and excellent customer service to prospective students and families. View Details Bookmark Visiting Lecturer of Interior Design 331000 - Art F0372026 Faculty 08/18/2026 The Department of Art and Design at the University of Central Arkansas invites applications for a full-time Visiting Assistant Professor or Visiting Lecturer I position in the Interior Design Program beginning January 2, 2027.The department seeks a candidate whose teaching and professional interests connect historical precedent, preservation research, and contemporary interior design practice. ... View Details Bookmark Student Worker - Exercise & Sport Science 343000 - Exercise and Sport Science S1682026 Student 08/19/2026 Provides administrative and operational support in a fast-paced, high-volume office environment. Assists staff, students, and visitors with routine inquiries and office needs while maintaining a professional and welcoming atmosphere. Responsibilities may include answering phones and emails, filing and organizing documents, data entry, preparing materials, processing paperwork, and assisting wit... View Details Bookmark Pre-BSN Student Coordinator 344000 - Nursing NC1022026 Staff 08/18/2026 The Pre-BSN Student Coordinator is to assist students in their growth and development by constructing meaningful educational plans which are compatible with their life goals. It is a continuous and consistent process which is built upon the basis of frequent, accumulated personal contacts between advisor and advisee. The Pre-BSN Student Coordinator is responsible for assessing, and counseling i... View Details Bookmark Graduate Administrative Assistant (GAA) 438100 - OCE Center Community Econ Dev G0152026 Graduate Assistant 04/28/2026 09/04/2026 The Center for Community & Economic Development Graduate Assistant provides support for the team’s various trainings, events, and community projects throughout the year. View Details Bookmark Graduate Teaching Assistant (GTA) 321100 - Child Study G0602026 Graduate Assistant 07/16/2026 View Details Bookmark Public Appearances Marketing Assistant (Non Federal) 339000 - Reynolds Performance Hall S1632026 Student 08/14/2026 Marketing Student Worker for Public Appearances View Details Bookmark AMUN Student Worker (Federal) - Fall Only 356000 - Govern/Public/Serv/Int Studies S1582026 Student 08/11/2026 09/04/2026 This is a federal work study position in the office of the Arkansas Model United Nation (AMUN) office in the Department of Government, Public Service, and International Studies. The position involves tasks related to preparing for the annual AMUN conference at UCA. View Details Bookmark AMUN Student Worker (Non-Federal) - Fall & Spring 356000 - Govern/Public/Serv/Int Studies S1592026 Student 08/11/2026 09/04/2026 This is a non-federal work study position in the office of the Arkansas Model United Nations (AMUN) in the Department of Government, Public Service, and International Studies. The position involves tasks related to the preparing for the annual AMUN conference at UCA. View Details Bookmark CLASS Third Party Verification Field Observer 320000 - Dean-College of Education NC0882026 Staff 07/14/2026 The Arkansas Research Center (ARC) at the University of Central Arkansas is seeking twelve full-time Regional CLASS Observers to conduct independent observations as part of its statewide CLASS Third-Party Observation Verification project, conducted on behalf of the Arkansas Department of Education, Office of Early Childhood. ARC has been engaged to conduct verification observations across all 7... View Details Bookmark Student Worker Clinic Assistant (Federal Work Study) 630000 - Office-Student Health Serv S1302026 Student 07/10/2026 The Dr. Randy Pastor Student Health Clinic is hiring student worker Clinic Assistants for Fall 2026. You must qualify for federal funds. We are looking for someone interested in patient care, preferably someone pursuing a degree in healthcare, although not required. This position may also assist working in the laboratory. The ideal applicant has excellent customer service skills and will be ple... View Details Bookmark Lifeguard/Student Worker (Non-Federal) 610000 - Thomas Courtway Recreation Center S0922026 Student 05/13/2026 09/15/2026 According to the lifeguard job description by the American Red Cross, a lifeguard is responsible for ensuring the safety of facility patrons by preventing and responding to emergencies. View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor of Music - Collaborative Piano 335000 - Music A0232026 Adjunct/Part-Time 06/01/2026 The University of Central Arkansas is searching for an Adjunct Collaborative Pianist. The faculty member is responsible for serving as accompanist for ensembles, recitals, degree recitals, faculty recitals, guest artist recitals, and instruction as needed. This position is governed by state and federal laws and agency/institution policy. The position is adjunct.The Department of Music in the Co... View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 Next University of Central Arkansas Human Resources 201 Donaghey Ave. Wingo Hall Conway, AR 72035 1.501.450.3181 1.501.450.5088 (fax) humanresources@uca.edu To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
